rows.before:
Yoshioka screaming that, and that's about it.
Even so, I never once thought about going back to help him.
Not even I wanted to go back in there again.{p}

rows.en:
Yoshioka screaming that, and that's about it.
Even so, I never once thought about going back to help him.
Even a guy like me didn't want to go back in there again.{p}

rows.before:
I screamed, without any regard for where I was.
I couldn't help it.
There in the coffin was Yoshioka's face, the same face I'd seen reflected in that mirror.{p}

rows.en:
I screamed, not caring where I was.
I couldn't help it.
There in the coffin was Yoshioka's face, the same face I'd seen reflected in that mirror.{p}

rows.before:
So they gave up and went to culinary school to try to recreate that candy on their own.
Talk about obsessed.
But in the end they failed at that and became an ordinary cook.{p}

rows.en:
So they gave up and went to culinary school to try to recreate that candy on their own.
Talk about obsessed.
But in the end they gave up on that too and just became a regular chef.{p}

rows.before:
"No luck today either..."
The sun had gone down completely, and there were no more students heading home.
Sakuma pinned his hopes on tomorrow again and decided to go home.{p}

rows.en:
"No luck today either..."
The sun had gone down completely, and there were no students left heading home from school.
Sakuma pinned his hopes on tomorrow once again and decided to go home.{p}

rows.before:
He ran like a madman.
When he finally stopped, unable to run another step, the old woman was nowhere to be seen.
Then he opened the hand still clutching the candy tight.{p}

rows.en:
He ran like a madman.
When he finally stopped, unable to run another step, the old lady was nowhere to be seen.
Then he opened the hand still clutching the candy tight.{p}

rows.before:
Katagiri was heading out the school gate, putting up with the pain of her cavities.
Just then, a voice called out to her.
"Are you all alone, dearie?"{p}

rows.en:
Katagiri was heading out the school gate, putting up with the pain of her cavities.
Just then, a voice called out to her.
"All by yourself, are you, dearie?"{p}

rows.before:
Because within a month of that moment, Sakuma will come to gouge out your eyeballs.
Not saying it is easy, but not thinking it is hard, right?
When you try not to think about it, you end up thinking about it even more.{p}

rows.en:
Because within a month of that moment, Sakuma will come to gouge out your eyeballs.
Not saying it is easy. Not thinking it is the hard part, right?
When you try not to think about it, you end up thinking about it even more.{p}

rows.before:
You think so?
Well, whatever, I'll keep going.
Tadokoro wished from the bottom of his heart that he could meet the upperclassman.{p}

rows.en:
You think so?
Well, whatever, I'll keep going.
Tadokoro wished from the bottom of his heart that he could meet the senior.{p}

rows.before:
Of course, the other first-years got way more than their share of training, too.
So some of them ran off.
One day, a few of the first-years got together and talked about running away.{p}

rows.en:
Of course, the other first-years got way more than their share of hazing, too.
So some of them ran off.
One day, a few of the first-years got together and talked about running away.{p}
